<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus estimates raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Michael O'Brien raised his fiscal 1997 earnings per share estimate on Novellus Systems Inc to $4.27 from $4.13 and raised fiscal 1998 to $5.75 from $5.55.</p>
<p>-- reiterated short- and long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 2-3/8 to 97-1/8.</p>
</text>
